  <item>
    <title>vol. 071 畅聊芝加哥马拉松、墨尔本马拉松以及一些跑者的碎碎念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690288d07f1b08483a4fc694</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690288d07f1b08483a4fc694</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Nov 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是一期线下录制，一下子没有搂住，直奔三小时去了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期请到的嘉宾是跑了芝加哥马拉松的Daniel Liu(老柳)以及跑了墨尔本马拉松的花教练（花椒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们除了聊了比赛，还围绕着近期国内外跑圈的一些事情，闲聊了一下。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhOSt9GqmGyA2dqi8xMwvTx9zPds.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln6FkcxxIB9FAhXz6ZZeGyoTPZQy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrLcHiNabD1p3_GmBNcxQV1ohYx.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">00:03:13</a> 芝加哥马拉松：一场充满憧憬和挑战的大马之旅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">00:15:48</a> 探秘黄石公园：壮丽景色与令人惊叹的地理奇观</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">00:30:45</a> 芝加哥：高楼林立的城市与独特的生活体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">00:45:39</a> 急性肠胃炎的急救指南：如何避免身边突发状况!</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3635">01:00:35</a> 照片里的感动瞬间：马拉松夫妻档的默契与坚持</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">01:15:31</a> 完美的跑步体验：芝加哥马拉松的天气和风景回顾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5428">01:30:28</a> 跑马拉松背后的代价：家庭的支持与个人的挑战</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6322">01:45:22</a> 跑马拉松：挑战自我极限的艰辛与荣耀</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7219">02:00:19</a> 澳洲跑步赛事：在家门口享受比赛的便利与激情!</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8115">02:15:15</a> 跑进MCG前的陡坡与返程挑战：一场充满仪式感的马拉松之旅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9011">02:30:11</a> 跑步训练的价值：马拉松比赛对身体的益处与挑战</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9908">02:45:08</a> 如何面对内心的跑步欲望？摆正心态坚持快乐运动</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lllm6VvzEgRUqjyK6MMBHvhnB5i-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqqFWCcBfCYI9WU-98sA5XU_AZ5V.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmxNZxNKbSnUgLMA0VA2uGO_bO_e.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhijiSZC8z8SEr6XByR4ewlKIrVr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuN2w63GZ0WHHkF87Dt0D8ptrLN3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn99hDzmN5DaH7B7Mfosp7j91ltN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrV3z3C6EE6eTbdwzOy4mWLyDz1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsnSJ5clMXf6UdmpEjv8Q6FVtB-P.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
